@annual_budget
title: The annual budget council
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.annual_budget_passed = 0;
Q.annual_budget_internal_backing = 0;
Q.annual_budget_internal_vetoes = 0;
Q.annual_budget_margin = 0;
Q.annual_budget_strategy = "Unsettled";
Q.budget_confidence_triggered = 0;
Q.budget_rescue_bonus = 0;
!}

= December [+ annual_budget_year +] — the vote that binds

[? if left_in_government: A budget is the coalition agreement with numbers
attached. <span class="party party-ko">KO</span> wants fiscal room,
<span class="party party-psl">PSL</span> wants rural protection, the centrist
caucuses want visible ministries, and every Left mini-party wants proof that
office purchased delivery. The President cannot use an ordinary veto to erase
an adopted budget, but delay and constitutional conflict can still weaponise
the process.?]

[? if not left_in_government: The Left is outside the cabinet and has no state
budget capacity. Its normal position is opposition. Supporting or abstaining
must therefore buy a public concession rather than imitate government.?]

- @government_social_protocol
- @government_rural_compact
- @government_minimum
- @government_dare
- @opposition_shadow
- @opposition_amendments
- @opposition_favour

@government_social_protocol
title: Bind housing, health, labour inspection and wages into one protocol
subtitle: Cost: 3 budget capacity. Strongest Left settlement; hardest PSL–KO negotiation.
view-if: left_in_government = 1
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and budget >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: The governing reserve cannot finance the protocol.
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget -= 3;
Q.annual_budget_strategy = "Funded social protocol";
Q.annual_budget_internal_backing = Math.max(
    52,
    82 - Math.round(Number(Q.internal_dissent) || 0) / 3
);
Q.annual_budget_internal_vetoes =
    (Q.barons_dissent >= 70 ? 1 : 0) +
    (Q.razem_dissent >= 70 ? 1 : 0);
Q.labor_credibility += 6;
Q.progressive_credibility += 3;
Q.razem_cooperation += 5;
Q.government_delivery += 5;
Q.psl_relation -= 4;
Q.ko_relation -= 2;
Q.fiscal_stress += 6;
Q.news_headline = "The Left turns its coalition promises into costed budget lines";
!}
go-to: budget_vote

@government_rural_compact
title: Exchange rural investment for care, housing and workplace enforcement
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity. Stabilises PSL; compromises the programme.
view-if: left_in_government = 1
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and budget >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: The governing reserve cannot carry both sides of the bargain.
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget -= 2;
Q.annual_budget_strategy = "Rural-social compact";
Q.annual_budget_internal_backing = Math.max(
    48,
    76 - Math.round(Number(Q.internal_dissent) || 0) / 3
);
Q.annual_budget_internal_vetoes =
    (Q.progressives_dissent >= 72 ? 1 : 0) +
    (Q.razem_dissent >= 65 ? 1 : 0);
Q.psl_relation += 8;
Q.rural_support += 4;
Q.household_security += 4;
Q.government_delivery += 3;
Q.progressives_dissent += 3;
Q.razem_dissent += 4;
Q.fiscal_stress += 3;
Q.news_headline = "A rural-social compact gives PSL a reason not to pull the pin";
!}
go-to: budget_vote

@government_minimum
title: Protect existing benefits and postpone the expensive promises
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Easier coalition arithmetic; severe movement cost.
view-if: left_in_government = 1
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Even the minimum package lacks a reserve.
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget -= 1;
Q.annual_budget_strategy = "Fiscal minimum";
Q.annual_budget_internal_backing = Math.max(
    38,
    65 - Math.round(Number(Q.internal_dissent) || 0) / 2
);
Q.annual_budget_internal_vetoes =
    (Q.labor_dissent >= 58 ? 1 : 0) +
    (Q.progressives_dissent >= 58 ? 1 : 0) +
    (Q.razem_dissent >= 48 ? 1 : 0);
Q.ko_relation += 5;
Q.psl_relation += 3;
Q.fiscal_stress -= 3;
Q.labor_credibility -= 4;
Q.razem_cooperation -= 7;
Q.budget_breaches += 2;
Q.news_headline = "The cabinet protects its floor and pushes the Left's deadlines away";
!}
go-to: budget_vote

@government_dare
title: Table the Left draft and dare partners to defeat the government
subtitle: No budget cost. Converts policy dissent into a confidence crisis.
view-if: left_in_government = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.annual_budget_strategy = "Coalition dare";
Q.annual_budget_internal_backing = Math.max(
    35,
    70 - Math.round(Number(Q.internal_dissent) || 0) / 2
);
Q.annual_budget_internal_vetoes =
    (Q.barons_dissent >= 60 ? 1 : 0) +
    (Q.spring_dissent >= 60 ? 1 : 0) +
    (Q.labor_dissent >= 60 ? 1 : 0) +
    (Q.progressives_dissent >= 60 ? 1 : 0) +
    (Q.razem_dissent >= 55 ? 1 : 0);
Q.party_unity += 2;
Q.psl_relation -= 12;
Q.ko_relation -= 8;
Q.government_coalition_dissent += 14;
Q.coalition_break_threat = 1;
Q.news_headline = "The Left turns the budget into a roll-call on coalition survival";
!}
go-to: budget_vote

@opposition_shadow
title: Vote no and publish a complete shadow budget
subtitle: The normal opposition line.
view-if: left_in_government = 0
on-arrival: annual_budget_strategy = "Opposition shadow budget"; annual_budget_internal_backing = 78; party_unity += 2; labor_credibility += 3; public_trust += 1; ko_relation -= 2; pis_relation -= 2; news_headline = "The Left votes no and prices its alternative"
go-to: opposition_result

@opposition_amendments
