Q.news_headline =
    "The annual budget passes after a full caucus count";
!}

= The government lives another year

The Senate may amend and delay, but the Sejm majority has survived the only
annual vote every faction knew it could not evade.

- @return_queue: Return to the remaining events

@budget_failed
title: Open the emergency coalition council
view-if: annual_budget_passed = 0
on-arrival: budget_confidence_triggered = 1; coalition_break_threat = 1; government_coalition_dissent += 12; public_trust -= 4; early_election_risk += 20; news_headline = "Budget defeat opens a confidence and early-election clock"
go-to: confidence_council

@confidence_council
title: Budget defeat — confidence council
new-page: true

= The four-month clock

The President can shorten the Sejm's term if a state budget is not presented
within the constitutional deadline. Coalition partners also need to decide
whether this cabinet, another prime minister, or an early election should own
the rescue.

- @confidence_psl_deal
- @confidence_left_redline
- @confidence_new_pm
- @confidence_snap

@confidence_psl_deal
title: Buy PSL back with a written rural guarantee
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity or 2 party resources.
choose-if: budget >= 2 or resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Neither the state reserve nor the party machine can carry the deal.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.budget >= 2) Q.budget -= 2;
else Q.resources -= 2;
Q.budget_rescue_bonus = 12;
Q.psl_relation += 12;
Q.progressives_dissent += 5;
Q.razem_dissent += 6;
Q.annual_budget_strategy += " + PSL rescue";
Q.news_headline = "A rural guarantee reopens the budget roll call";
!}
go-to: confidence_roll

@confidence_left_redline
title: Rebuild the majority around the funded Left protocol
subtitle: Risks office rather than surrendering the programme.
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget_rescue_bonus = 5;
Q.party_unity += 4;
Q.labor_credibility += 4;
Q.progressive_credibility += 3;
Q.ko_relation -= 5;
Q.psl_relation -= 6;
Q.government_coalition_dissent += 4;
Q.annual_budget_strategy += " + Left redline";
Q.news_headline =
    "The Left makes programme delivery the price of confidence";
!}
go-to: confidence_roll

@confidence_new_pm
title: Offer a new democratic prime minister before the Palace intervenes
subtitle: The coalition survives only if its caucuses accept the replacement.
on-arrival: {!
Q.confidence_candidate = "Coalition replacement";
Q.budget_rescue_bonus = 8;
Q.ko_relation -= 4;
Q.p2050_relation += 3;
Q.psl_relation += 3;
Q.party_unity -= 2;
Q.government_coalition_dissent += 3;
Q.annual_budget_strategy += " + replacement cabinet";
Q.news_headline =
    "The coalition searches for a prime minister who can carry the budget";
!}
go-to: confidence_roll

@confidence_snap
title: Accept a snap parliamentary election
subtitle: Ends the budget negotiation and sends every caucus to the voters.
on-arrival: coalition_broken = 1; government_has_confidence = 0; caretaker_government = 1; left_in_government = 0; budget = 0; position = "Snap-election campaign"; coalition_status = "Caretaker after budget defeat"; early_election_risk = 100; snap_election_requested = 1; annual_budget_result = "Failed — snap election accepted"; party_unity -= 4; news_headline = "The coalition chooses an early election over another bargain"

= The chamber dissolves politically

The constitutional route still requires the formal deadline, a Sejm
self-dissolution vote, or another failed cabinet sequence. The campaign begins
before lawyers finish choosing the mechanism.

- @return_queue: Return to the remaining events

@confidence_roll
title: The rescue vote
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const startingYes = Math.max(
    0,
    Number(Q.annual_budget_yes) || 0
);
const unityBonus = Math.round(
    ((Number(Q.party_unity) || 0) - 45) / 8
);
const relationBonus = Math.round(
    (
        (Number(Q.ko_relation) || 0) +
        (Number(Q.psl_relation) || 0) +
        (Number(Q.p2050_relation) || 0) -
        105
    ) / 18
);
const roll = Math.floor(
    (this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 7
) - 3;
Q.confidence_yes = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        460,
        startingYes +
            (Number(Q.budget_rescue_bonus) || 0) +
            unityBonus +
            relationBonus +
            roll
    )
);
Q.confidence_no = Math.max(0, 460 - Q.confidence_yes - 4);
Q.confidence_abstain =
    460 - Q.confidence_yes - Q.confidence_no;
Q.confidence_threshold = 231;
Q.confidence_present = 460;
Q.confidence_mode = "Budget rescue and confidence";
Q.confidence_candidate =
    Q.confidence_candidate == "Coalition replacement"
        ? "Coalition replacement"
        : Q.prime_minister;
Q.government_has_confidence = Q.confidence_yes >= 231 ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.government_has_confidence) {
    Q.annual_budget_passed = 1;
    Q["annual_budget_passed_" + Q.annual_budget_year] = 1;
    Q.annual_budget_margin = Q.confidence_yes - 230;
    Q.annual_budget_result =
        "Rescued with " + Q.confidence_yes + " confidence votes";
    Q.government_coalition_dissent -= 5;
    Q.early_election_risk = Math.max(0, Q.early_election_risk - 15);
} else {
    Q.coalition_broken = 1;
    Q.caretaker_government = 1;
    Q.left_in_government = 0;
    Q.budget = 0;
    Q.position = "Caretaker cabinet and formation talks";
    Q.coalition_status = "Budget rescue failed";
    Q.early_election_risk = Math.max(75, Q.early_election_risk);
    Q.snap_election_requested = 1;
    Q.annual_budget_result =
        "Budget and confidence lost with " +
        Q.confidence_yes + " votes";
}
!}

= Confidence roll call

**Yes [+ confidence_yes +] · No [+ confidence_no +] · Abstain [+
confidence_abstain +]**

[? if government_has_confidence: The rescue carries. The cabinet survives,
but the concessions are now part of every caucus's next manifesto.?]
[? if not government_has_confidence: The rescue fails. The Palace receives
another opportunity to designate a prime minister while the Sejm searches for
231 votes—or an election.?]

